* A macro defined in code and called in a vsect: r68 puts its dc and ds in the vsect, as a
* macro's lines go where it is called.
* known: open (found 2026-10-10): r68togas translates a macro's dc/ds by the section where it is defined
* expect text: 41ee0000
* expect data: 6f6e6500
* expect size: .bss 4
 psect macro_vsect_call,0,0,0,0,0
DEFS macro
_S\1 dc.b "\1",0
 endm
VAR macro
\1 ds.l 1
 endm
 vsect
 DEFS one
 VAR two
 ends
 lea _Sone(a6),a0
 ends
